Weapon Abilities Glossary
These keywords describe how a weapon functions.

Pistol X: This weapon can be fired even if the unit it is equipped with is within Engagement Range of an enemy unit. If it is fired, it can only target an enemy unit that it is within Engagement Range of. When a model equipped with both a Pistol and another type of weapon (e.g., a Rapid Fire weapon) shoots, it can either shoot with its Pistol(s) or its other weapons. X is the number of attacks it makes.
*Example: A Pistol 1 weapon makes 1 attack. A Pistol D3 weapon rolls one D6 to determine the number of attacks: 1-2 = 1 attack, 3-4 = 2 attacks, 5-6 = 3 attacks.*

Heavy X: This weapon can only be fired once per turn. If the unit that is equipped with it Remained Stationary (did not make a Normal Move, Advance, or Fall Back) in the same turn, add +1 to hit rolls made with this weapon. X is the number of attacks it makes.
*Example: A Heavy 1 weapon makes 1 attack. If the model didn't move, it hits on a 3+ instead of a 4+.*

Rapid Fire X: This weapon can be fired once per turn. If the target is within half of this weapon's range, it makes X additional attacks.
Example: A Rapid Fire 1 plasma gun with a 15cm range makes 1 attack normally. If the target is within 7.5cm, it makes 2 attacks instead.

Assault X: This weapon can be fired even if the unit that is equipped with it Advanced in the same turn. However, if it does, you must subtract 1 from hit rolls made with this weapon. X is the number of attacks it makes.
Example: An Assault 2 weapon makes 2 attacks, even if the unit moved fast.

Torrent: A weapon with this ability automatically hits its target. You do not need to make a hit roll. You must still make wound rolls and the target can still make save rolls.

Indirect Fire: This weapon can target an enemy unit that is not visible to the attacking model. If it does, however, the target unit benefits from Cover (improves its save by 1) against those attacks.

Ignores Cover: The target unit cannot benefit from Cover saves against attacks made with this weapon.
